AltoMarket::setLiquidationEngine
├── when caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert
└── when caller is owner
    ├── when new liquidation engine is zero address
    │   └── it should revert
    ├── when current liquidation engine is zero address
    │   └── it should revert
    └── when both are non-zero
        ├── it should emit SetLiquidationEngine event
        ├── it should update liquidationEngine
        └── it should call setMarketOnce on new liquidation engine
